<!-- Brain map: the integrals of vector calculus.
     Drop into source/sections/ (or wherever your section fragments live) and
     pull it in with  <xi:include href="sections/subsec-brain-map.ptx"/>.
     Requires assets/brain-map.html (external dir) and the qrcode stub
